+--------------+----------------+------------+--------------------------------+

+----------------+--------------+----------------------------------------+
| NumOfInstances | int          | Number of instances in a series        |
+================+==============+========================================+
| Location       | Varchar(255) |                                        |
+----------------+--------------+----------------------------------------+
| LesionDepth    | Decimal      | The Depth measured when image acquired |
