[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10SG-13
TITLE: High Level System Architecture
STATEMENT: >>>
Approvals Calibration - Heater current configuration.

The application is comprised of two key components: Heracles Device Control console (Indoor application) and Treatment Control console (Outdoor application).

The Heracles Device Control console is integrated within the Heracles device. This application addresses functionalities related to patients, demographic data management, clinical data management, treatment data management, Image acquisition, user access, clinical workflows, and system setup and services.

The Treatment Control application must be located in a console outside the treatment room. This is to provide the operator with a safe work environment. It should allow healthcare professionals e.g., radiation therapists (RTT), and physicians to activate the radiation emission for the patient's treatment and to provide tools for physicists to program the system's calibration values.
<<<

