[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10SG-100
TITLE: System Data management
STATEMENT: >>>
The application shall include a centralized and secure data repository for storing device system data, including calibration data, system settings, QC history, and warmup history.

The data shall be managed in a relational database.

Entity Relationship Diagram

Data Entities:

CollimatorConfiguration Table

+------------+----------+------------+-------------+
| Name       | Type     | constraint | Description |
+============+==========+============+=============+
| ID         | Int64    |            |             |
+------------+----------+------------+-------------+
| CreateDate | DateTime | Not Null   |             |
+------------+----------+------------+-------------+

+--------------------+----------------+----------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| Type               | TargetTypeEnum | Not Null | Unique with Energy and SSD                                                                      |
+====================+================+==========+=================================================================================================+
| Energy             | Energy Enum    | Not Null | Unique with Type and SSD                                                                        |
+--------------------+----------------+----------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| SSD                | SSDType Enum   | Not Null | Unique with Type and Energy                                                                     |
+--------------------+----------------+----------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| ReferencedDoseRate | Decimal        |          | Dose rate in the a specific cell in the collimator that serves as referenced to all other cells |
+--------------------+----------------+----------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+

