[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10SG-333
TITLE: Automatically Identify connected collimator type and configuration
STATEMENT: >>>
The Identification of the connected Collimator will be done according to the following sequence diagram:

1. The C&C app queries the connected collimator (chip) for its ID (64-bit ID).

1. The C&C queries DB Service (Moses) for the collimator data for this ID. The return value includes a foreign key for the collimator\_configuration.

2. The C&C queries DB Service for the collimator's configuration, which returns the Type, Energy, and SSD of the connected collimator.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H10SG-332
  ROLE: Refines

[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10SG-378
TITLE: Patient - Plan View - Auto-calculate the ICDCode - ICD Code table
STATEMENT: >>>
ICD Code will be generated based on the lesion location (Field Location) and the Pathology as set by the operator:

The calculation will use the following table:

+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-----------+--------------------------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+-----------------------------+---------------------+
|                                                                              | ICDforBCC | ICDforSCC                                              | ICDforSCC-15                           | ICDforBasosquam             | ICD for Keloid      |
+==============================================================================+===========+========================================================+========================================+=============================+=====================+
| Location                                                                     |           | Basal Cell Carcinoma (Bcc)Squamous Cell Carcinoma(ScC) | Squamous CellCarcinoma-in Situ(SCC-IS) | Basosquamous Cell Carcinoma | Keloid L91.0, L73.0 |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-----------+--------------------------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+-----------------------------+---------------------+
| Breast                                                                       | C44.511   | C44.521                                                | D04.5                                  | C44.591                     |                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-----------+--------------------------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+-----------------------------+---------------------+
| Ear (Left)                                                                   | C44.219   | C44.229                                                | D04.22                                 | C44.299                     |                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-----------+--------------------------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+-----------------------------+---------------------+
| Ear (Right)                                                                  | C44.212   | C44.222                                                | D04.21                                 | C44.292                     |                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-----------+--------------------------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+-----------------------------+---------------------+
| Face&Other Parts of Face [Ex. Cheek,Chin, Forehead,Jaw,Pre-Auricular,Zygoma) | C44.319   | C44.329                                                | D04.39                                 | C44.399                     |                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-----------+--------------------------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+-----------------------------+---------------------+
| Lip                                                                          | C44.01    | C44.02                                                 | D04.0                                  | C44.09                      |                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-----------+--------------------------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+-----------------------------+---------------------+
| Neck                                                                         | C44.41    | C44.42                                                 | D04.4                                  | C44.49                      |                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-----------+--------------------------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+-----------------------------+---------------------+
| Nose (Ex. Ala, Bridge, Tip, Root)                                            | C44.311   | C44.321                                                | D04.39                                 | C44.391                     |                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-----------+--------------------------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+-----------------------------+---------------------+
| Scalp &Post Auricular                                                        | C44.41    | C44.42                                                 | D04.4                                  | C44.49                      |                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-----------+--------------------------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+-----------------------------+---------------------+
| Trunk/Chest/Abdomen/Back                                                     | C44.519   | C44.529                                                | D04.5                                  | C44.599                     |                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-----------+--------------------------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+-----------------------------+---------------------+
| Lower Limb (Left) (Including Hip)                                            | C44.719   | C44.729                                                | D04.72                                 | C44.799                     |                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-----------+--------------------------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+-----------------------------+---------------------+
| Lower Limb (Right) (Including Hip)                                           | C44.712   | C44.722                                                | D04.71                                 | C44.792                     |                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-----------+--------------------------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+-----------------------------+---------------------+
| Upper Limb (Left) (including Shoulder)                                       | C44.619   | C44.629                                                | D04.62                                 | C44.699                     |                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-----------+--------------------------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+-----------------------------+---------------------+
| Upper Limb (Right) (including Shoulder)                                      | C44.612   | C44.622                                                | D04.61                                 | C44.692                     |                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-----------+--------------------------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+-----------------------------+---------------------+
| Eyelids:                                                                     | C44.1121  | C44.1221                                               | D04.111                                | C44.1992                    |                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-----------+--------------------------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+-----------------------------+---------------------+
| Eyelid (Right Upper) Eyelid (Right Lower)including Canthus                   | C44.1122  | C44.1222                                               | D04.112                                | C44.1991                    |                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-----------+--------------------------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+-----------------------------+---------------------+
| Eyelid (Left Upper)                                                          | C44.1191  | C44.1291                                               | D04.121                                | C44.1922                    |                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-----------+--------------------------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+-----------------------------+---------------------+
| Eyelid (Left Lower) including Canthus                                        | C44.1192  | C44.1292                                               | D04.122                                | C44.1921                    |                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-----------+--------------------------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+-----------------------------+---------------------+
| Unspecified Parts of Face (Find More Specific Fit)                           | C44.310   | C44.320                                                | D04.30                                 |                             |                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-----------+--------------------------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+-----------------------------+---------------------+
| Unspecified Codes (Find More Specific Fit)                                   | C44.91    | C44.92                                                 | D04.9                                  |                             |                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-----------+--------------------------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+-----------------------------+---------------------+
| Unspecified Eyelid (Find More Specific Fit)                                  | C44.111   | C44.121                                                | D04.10                                 |                             |                     |
