[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10SG-677
TITLE: Move to QC Panel Sequence
STATEMENT: >>>
The application shall provide a mechanism for moving from the current interface to the Quality Control (QC) panel. The sequence for navigating to the QC panel shall be implemented according to the Quality Assurance module flow.

Fulfilled requirements:
- RQ-H10SG-379-#8: Quality Assurance - Move to QC Panel
<<<

[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10SG-679
TITLE: Save Lesion Depth Flow
STATEMENT: >>>
The application shall provide functionality to save the lesion depth value acquired during image acquisition into the simulation module. The lesion depth shall be captured and populated into the patient's simulation parameters for treatment planning purposes.

Fulfilled requirements:
- RQ-H10SG-376-#6: Patients - Image Acquisition - Populate Lesion Depth into Simulation
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H10SG-376
  ROLE: Refines

[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10SG-680
TITLE: New Collimator Mandatory Fields
STATEMENT: >>>
The Mandatory field of a Collimator should be:

- Serial - Automatically identified from telemetry.

- Type, Energy, and SSD should be fetched/saved from the Configuration Table.

Collimator Table

+----------------------------+---------+------------+-----------------------------------------------+
| Name                       | Type    | constraint | Description                                   |
+============================+=========+============+===============================================+
| ID                         | Int64   | Not Null   | Primary key. Auto incremental                 |
+----------------------------+---------+------------+-----------------------------------------------+
| HeadID                     | Int64   | Not Null   | Foreign Key to Head table                     |
+----------------------------+---------+------------+-----------------------------------------------+
| CollimatorConfigurati onID | Int64   | Not Null   | Foreign Key to CollimatorConfigurati on table |
+----------------------------+---------+------------+-----------------------------------------------+
| CreateDate                 | Date    | Not Null   |                                               |
+----------------------------+---------+------------+-----------------------------------------------+
| Serial                     | String  | Not Null   | Unique                                        |
+----------------------------+---------+------------+-----------------------------------------------+
| IsActive                   | Tinyint | Not Null   |                                               |
+----------------------------+---------+------------+-----------------------------------------------+

CollimatorConfiguration Table

+--------------------+----------------+------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+
| Name               | Type           | constraint | Description                                                    |
+====================+================+============+================================================================+
| ID                 | Int64          |            |                                                                |
+--------------------+----------------+------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+
| CreateDate         | DateTime       | Not Null   |                                                                |
+--------------------+----------------+------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+
| Type               | TargetTypeEnum | Not Null   | Unique with Energy and SSD                                     |
+--------------------+----------------+------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+
| Energy             | Energy Enum    | Not Null   | Unique with Type and SSD                                       |
+--------------------+----------------+------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+
| SSD                | SSDType Enum   | Not Null   | Unique with Type and Energy                                    |
+--------------------+----------------+------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+
| ReferencedDoseRate | Decimal        |            | Dose rate in the a specific cell in the collimator that serves |
+--------------------+----------------+------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+

The Entity Relationship Diagram
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H10SG-321
  ROLE: Refines

